p>4.&nbsp;&nbsp; I understand that my fully anonymised data will be used for the purpose of this study.<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>5.&nbsp;&nbsp; I understand that the data collected about me will be used to support other research in the future, and may be shared anonymously with other researchers. <\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>6.&nbsp;&nbsp; I give permission for all the anonymised data and transcripts that I provide to be deposited in public repository (e.g., Open Science Framework) so that they will be available for future research and learning activities by other individuals.<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>7.&nbsp;&nbsp; I agree to take part in the above study.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>Please select your answer below to indicate whether you consent or not to participate in the study\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"DataExportTag":"Q902","QuestionID":"QID902"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID596","SecondaryAttribute":"CONSENT FORM \u00a0 Antibiotics expectations \u00a0 Researchers:\u00a0 Miss Andriana Theodoropoulou, Dr Miroslav","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I AGREE and consent to participate in this research"},"2":{"Display":"I DO NOT AGREE and withdraw from participating in this research"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Consent","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"CONSENT FORM \u00a0 Antibiotics expectations \u00a0 Researchers:\u00a0 Miss Andriana Theodoropoulou, Dr Miroslav...","QuestionID":"QID596","QuestionText":"<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-AU\" lang=\"EN-AU\">CONSENT FORM<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-AU\" lang=\"EN-AU\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;color:#00000A\">Antibiotics expectations<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nCalibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nCalibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\" lang=\"EN-US\">Researchers:<span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:\n12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nCalibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\" lang=\"EN-US\">Miss Andriana Theodoropoulou, Dr Miroslav Sirota, Dr Jonathan Rolison,<br>\nDr Matteo Lisi.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nCalibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Please read the following statements carefully:<\/span><\/u><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">1.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">I confirm that I<\/span><span style=\"font-size:\n12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"> have read and understand the Information Sheet for the above study <\/span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">and that I have been given the contact information of the researchers and the opportunity to ask any questions.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">2.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">I understand that my participation is voluntary and that I am free to withdraw from the project at any time without giving any reason and without penalty.<\/span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:black;mso-themecolor:\ntext1\" lang=\"EN-US\"> <\/span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">I understand that my data cannot be deleted after I have completed the experiment, because the data are stored anonymously, so it will not be possible to identify my data.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\n107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">3.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\">I understand that the identifiable data provided will be securely stored and accessible only to the members of the research team directly involved in the project or other researchers under the direction of the Principal Investigator, and that confidentiality will be maintained.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\n107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">4.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">I consent to have my data published in research publications, in which case the data will remain completely anonymous<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">5.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">I understand that the data collected about me will be used to support other research in the future and may be shared anonymously with other researchers.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">6.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">I give permission for all the anonymized data and transcripts that I provide to be deposited in a public repository (Open Science Framework) so that they will be available for future research and learning activities by other individuals.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">7.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">I agree to take part in the above study.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">Please click the box below to indicate whether you agree or do not agree to give your consent to participate in the research<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-l