refully:<\/span><\/u><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">1.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">I confirm that I<\/span><span style=\"font-size:\n12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"> have read and understand the Information Sheet for the above study <\/span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">and that I have been given the contact information of the researchers and the opportunity to ask any questions.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">2.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">I understand that my participation is voluntary and that I am free to withdraw from the project at any time without giving any reason and without penalty.<\/span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;color:black;mso-themecolor:\ntext1\" lang=\"EN-US\"> <\/span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">I understand that my data cannot be deleted after I have completed the experiment, because the data are stored anonymously, so it will not be possible to identify my data.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\n107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">3.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\">I understand that the identifiable data provided will be securely stored and accessible only to the members of the research team directly involved in the project or other researchers under the direction of the Principal Investigator, and that confidentiality will be maintained.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\n107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">4.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">I consent to have my data published in research publications, in which case the data will remain completely anonymous<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">5.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\n115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">I understand that the data collected about me will be used to support other research in the future and may be shared anonymously with other researchers.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">6.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">I give permission for all the anonymized data and transcripts that I provide to be deposited in a public repository (Open Science Framework) so that they will be available for future research and learning activities by other individuals.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\">7.<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">I agree to take part in the above study.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">Please click the box below to indicate whether you agree or do not agree to give your consent to participate in the research<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID597","SecondaryAttribute":"CONSENT FORM \u00a0 Open Science (OS) perceptions in YUFE researchers \u00a0 Researchers responsible: Dr Mi.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I AGREE and consent to participate in this research"},"2":{"Display":"I DO NOT AGREE and withdraw from participating in this research"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Consent","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"CONSENT FORM \u00a0 Open Science (OS) perceptions in YUFE researchers \u00a0 Researchers responsible: Dr Mi...","QuestionID":"QID597","QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-AU\" style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 10);\">CONSENT FORM<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-AU\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-AU\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; color: rgb(0, 0, 10);\">Open Science (OS) perceptions in YUFE researchers <\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nCalibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 115%; color: rgb(0, 0, 10);\">Researchers responsible: <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 115%; color: rgb(0, 0, 10);\">Dr Miroslav Sirota and Andriana Theodoropoulou<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nCalibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Dear participant,<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">This study is about current Open Science (OS) perceptions and practices among YUFE (Young Universities for the Future of Europe) researchers. The study will take around 15 minutes to complete. You will be asked to answer a range of questions concerning your implementation of OS practices in your research, and your perception of the opportunities and barriers to implementing these practices. You will also provide some basic information about yourself, but the questionnaire is completely anonymous.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Data collected through this study will be aggregated and you will not be individually identifiable in any reports or publications from this research. Your data will be gathered and curated by the YUFERING partners at the University of Essex (Responsible researchers: Dr Miroslav Sirota and Andriana Theodoropoulou). Your anonymous data may be shared in permanent, publicly accessible archives accessible from any country.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Your participation is voluntary and you are free to withdraw from the study at any time without giving any reason and without penalty. If you wish to withdraw, simply close your browser window. Incomplete responses will be considered withdrawn and will be deleted. It will not be possible to withdraw from the study once you have completed and submitted the questionnaire, because we will not be able to identify your data.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">For more information about the study and your rights as a participant in this research please download a copy of the participant information sheet which can be found at this link [to amend once approved with an OSF link].<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">If you have any questions or concerns about any aspect of the study or you have a complaint, please contact the Researchers responsible (msirota@essex.ac.uk or a.theodoropoulou@essex.ac.uk) or the YUFERING WP5 leader (emendez@bib.uc3m.es)<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><u><strong>Statement of consent<\/strong><\/u><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">By completing this online study you are consenting to the following:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>1<\/strong>. I agree to participate in the research project &ldquo;Open Science perceptions in YUFE researchers&rdquo; being carried out by the YUFERING partners at the University of Essex (Responsible researchers: Dr Miroslav Sirota and Andriana Theodoropoulou)<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>2<\/strong>. I am 18 years or older<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>3<\/strong>. This agreement has been given voluntarily and without coercion.<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>4<\/strong>. I have been given full information about the study and contact details of the researcher(s).<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>5<\/strong>. I have read and understood the information provided above.<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>6<\/strong>. I agree to have my anonymised data shared on publicly accessible repositories.<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>7<\/strong>. I have had the opportunity to ask questions about the research and my participation in it, and I am aware that I can withdraw the survey at any time before submitting it.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\">Please click the box below to indicate whether you agree or do not agree to give your consent to participate in the research<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-AU\" style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 10);\">CONSENT FORM<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-AU\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-AU\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; color: rgb(0, 0, 10);\">Open Science (OS) perceptions in YUFE researchers <\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nCalibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 115%; color: rgb(0, 0, 10);\">Researchers responsible: <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 115%; color: rgb(0, 0, 10);\">Dr Miroslav Sirota and Andriana Theodoropoulou<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nCalibri;color:#00000A;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Dear participant,<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">This study is about current Open Science (OS) perceptions and practices among YUFE (Young Universities for the Future of Europe) researchers. The study will take around 15 minutes to complete. You will be asked to answer a range of questions concerning your implementation of OS practices in your research, and your perception of the opportunities and barriers to implementing these practices. You will also provide some basic information about yourself, but the questionnaire is completely anonymous.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Data collected through this study will be aggregated and you will not be individually identifiable in any reports or publications from this research. Your data will be gathered and curated by the YUFERING partners at the University of Essex (Responsible researchers: Dr Miroslav Sirota and Andriana Theodoropoulou). Your anonymous data may be shared in permanent, publicly accessible archives accessible from any country.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Your participation is voluntary and you are free to withdraw from the study at any time without giving any reason and without penalty. If you wish to withdraw, simply close your browser window. Incomplete responses will be considered withdrawn and will be deleted. It will not be possible to withdraw from the study once you have completed and submitted the questionnaire, because we will not be able to identify your data.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">For more information about the study and your rights as a participant in this research please download a copy of the participant information sheet which can be found at this link [to amend once approved with an OSF link].<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">If you have any questions or concerns about any aspect of the study or you have a complaint, please contact the Researchers responsible (msirota@essex.ac.uk or a.theodoropoulou@essex.ac.uk) or the YUFERING WP5 leader (emendez@bib.uc3m.es)<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><u><strong>Statement of consent<\/strong><\/u><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">By completing this online study you are consenting to the following:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>1<\/strong>. I agree to participate in the research project &ldquo;Open Science perceptions in YUFE researchers&rdquo; being carried out by the YUFERING partners at the University of Essex (Responsible researchers: Dr Miroslav Sirota and Andriana Theodoropoulou)<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>2<\/strong>. I am 18 years or older<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>3<\/strong>. This agreement has been given voluntarily and without coercion.<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>4<\/strong>. I have been given full information about the study and contact details of the researcher(s).<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>5<\/strong>. I have read and understood the information provided above.<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>6<\/strong>. I agree to have my anonymised data shared on publicly accessible repositories.<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><strong>7<\/strong>. I have had the opportunity to ask questions about the research and my participation in it, and I am aware that I can withdraw the survey at any time before submitting it.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\">Please click the box below to indicate whether you agree or do not agree to give your consent to participate in the research<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:\nEN-GB\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID478","SecondaryAttribute":"Counting task How many times does the letter \u201cA\u201d appear in the picture?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><strong>Counting task<\/strong><br \/>\n<img src=\"https:\/\/essex.eu.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_72pPoxvOwhXH3A