stionID":"QID1095"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1096","SecondaryAttribute":"Have you ever encountered this reasoning problem before starting our study?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Have you ever encountered this reasoning problem before starting our study?","DataExportTag":"crt5_IJ_familiarity","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Have you ever encountered this reasoning problem before starting our study?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<strong>yes, I did <\/strong>encounter this or a similar problem before"},"2":{"Display":"<strong>no, I did not <\/strong>encounter this or a similar problem before"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1096"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1097","SecondaryAttribute":"Have you ever encountered this reasoning problem before starting our study?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Have you ever encountered this reasoning problem before starting our study?","DataExportTag":"crt6_IJ_familiarity","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Have you ever encountered this reasoning problem before starting our study?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<strong>yes, I did <\/strong>encounter this or a similar problem before"},"2":{"Display":"<strong>no, I did not <\/strong>encounter this or a similar problem before"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1097"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID829","SecondaryAttribute":"Have you used any external resources to answer any of the reasoning problems listed below. This m...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Have you used any external resources to answer any of the reasoning problems listed below. This means using search engines like Google, Yahoo, Bing, or artificial intelligence platforms like ChatGPT, Gemini (previously known as Bard), or anything else (e.g., discussing with somebody else), to solve the problems?<br>\n<br>\nPlease be assured that your compensation will not be affected by your answers. We value your honesty and encourage you to answer truthfully!","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ext_resources_use","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Have you used any external resources to answer any of the reasoning problems listed below. This m...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"3":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID829","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"RecodeValues":{"1":"1","3":"2"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1017","SecondaryAttribute":"Have you used successfully any external resources to answer any of the reasoning problems listed...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Have you used successfully any external resources to answer any of the reasoning problems listed below? This means using search engines like Google, Yahoo, Bing, or artificial intelligence platforms like ChatGPT, Gemini (previously known as Bard), or anything else (e.g., discussing with somebody else), to solve the problems?<br><br>Please be assured that your compensation will not be affected by your answers. We value your honesty and encourage you to answer truthfully!","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ext_resources_use","QuestionID":"QID1017","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Have you used successfully any external resources to answer any of the reasoning problems listed...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\">Emma&rsquo;s father loves the seasons and the cyclical changes in nature. He has four daughters, and the names of the first three are Spring, Summer, and Autumn. The name of the fourth daughter is:<\/span>"},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\">Ellen is driving in a car race and she overtakes a driver who is in 34th place. What is Ellen&#39;s current position?<span style=\"background-color:#000000;\">\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b<\/span><\/span>"},"8":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\">Usain ran a 200-metre race in Paris and achieved the tenth quickest and tenth slowest time. How many runners ran in this race?<\/span>"},"9":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\">A car factory has 100 new industrial robot arms that can manufacture 100 self- driving cars in 100 minutes. How many minutes must 200 industrial robots take to manufacture 200 self-driving cars?<\/span>"},"10":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\">Marie used a strong yeast for making bread dough. In a large bowl, a dough ball doubles in size every hour. Marie left the dough for 24 hours and it filled the bowl completely. If she only wanted half the bowl filled, how long should she leave the dough?<\/span>"},"11":{"Display":"<span style=\"color:#000000;\">Anna can build a treehouse in 4 weeks, while Mia can build the same treehouse in 12 weeks. How many weeks would it take for them to build one treehouse together?<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","3","8","9","10","11"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"RecodeValues":{"1":"1","2":"2"},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":18,"NextAnswerId":4,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"<strong>yes, I did <\/strong> use external resources to answer this problem"},"2":{"Display":"<strong>no, I did not <\/strong> use any external resources to answer this problem"}},"AnswerOrder":["1","2"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"AnswerColumns":2,"SubSelector":"SingleAnswer"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID369","SecondaryAttribute":"Here is the code you have to enter to complete the job:Gs34vQ Please make sure to click on the ne...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Here is the code you have to enter to complete the job:<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Gs34vQ<\/strong><br>\n<br>\n<br>\nPlease make sure to click on the next button to complete the study. Otherwise your response will not be recorded. Thanks again for your participation.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q47","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Here is the code you have to enter to complete the job:Gs34vQ Please make sure to click on the ne...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Here is the code you have to enter to complete the job:<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Gs34vQ<\/strong><br>\n<br>\n<br>\nPlease make sure to click on the next button to complete the study. Otherwise your response will not be recorded. Thanks again for your participation.","QuestionID":"QID369"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1105","SecondaryAttribute":"How carefully do you believe the explanations of your answers to the reasoning problems will be r...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload