. Please answer the following demoghraphic questions:<\/span>","QuestionID":"QID365"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID71","SecondaryAttribute":"Ok. This is the end of practice. Push the \"Next\" button if you are ready to start.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q114","DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionDescription":"Ok. This is the end of practice. Push the \"Next\" button if you are ready to start.","QuestionID":"QID71","QuestionText":"<strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Ok. This is the end of practice. Push the &quot;Next&quot; button if you are ready to start.<\/strong>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Ok. This is the end of practice. Push the &quot;Next&quot; button if you are ready to start.<\/strong>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID824","SecondaryAttribute":"Okay, this was the first practice problem. We will present you with another practice problem to m...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Okay, this was the first practice problem. We will present you with another practice problem to make sure that the procedure is really clear.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q824","QuestionID":"QID824","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Okay, this was the first practice problem. We will present you with another practice problem to m...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID449","SecondaryAttribute":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many co...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Instructions_CG","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":1,"QuestionDescription":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many co...","QuestionID":"QID449","QuestionText":"<p>On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible.&nbsp;<\/b><\/p><p><strong><br><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Please click 'next' to continue.<\/strong><\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>In the next section, we will ask you <strong>to solve the same eight word problems again<\/strong>.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>This time, <strong>we will give you feedback on your previous answer<\/strong>: we will tell you whether your answer was correct or not and <em>explain<\/em> why this is the case. You will have the opportunity to provide a new answer to the same problem, so if you initially made an incorrect answer then you can change your initial answer.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Before we start, we are going to ask you to complete a word categorisation task on the next page.<\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID903","SecondaryAttribute":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many co...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":1,"QuestionDescription":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many co...","QuestionText":"<p>On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible.&nbsp;<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Please note that we will ask you to <strong>justify your answer<\/strong> to each question by <b>writing an explanation of your reasoning in a few sentences.<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Please click 'next' to continue.<\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible. <\/b>After every problem, we will ask you about how sure you are that the answer you provided is correct.<\/p><p><strong><br><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Please click 'next' to continue.<\/strong><\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataExportTag":"Instructions_BJ","QuestionID":"QID903"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID966","SecondaryAttribute":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many co...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":1,"QuestionDescription":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many co...","QuestionText":"<p>On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible.&nbsp;<\/b><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><\/p><b>In this study, we are interested in the process that you used to get to your answer. <\/b>Therefore, please note that you will have to <b>explain your answer to the problem by writing a detailed description<\/b> of your reasoning in a short paragraph.  <b>Your justification will be reviewed by several members of the research team.\n<\/b><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Please click 'next' to continue.<\/strong><\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible.&nbsp;<\/b><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Please note that we will ask you to justify your answer to each question by <b>writing an explanation of your reasoning in one sentence or more.<\/b><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>After every problem, we will also ask you about how sure you are that the answer you provided is correct.<\/p><p><strong><br><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Please click 'next' to continue.<\/strong><\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataExportTag":"Instructions_IJ","QuestionID":"QID966"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1019","SecondaryAttribute":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many co...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":1,"QuestionDescription":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many co...","QuestionText":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible. <br><br>Please note that we will ask you to justify your answer to each question by writing an explanation of your reasoning in a few sentences.\n\n \nThe quality of your justification will be evaluated by several members of the research team to rate your reasoning abilities.\n \n\nPlease click 'next' to continue.","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible.&nbsp;<\/b><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><\/p><b>In this study, we are interested in the process that you used to get to your answer. <\/b>Therefore, please note that you will have to <b>explain your answer to the problem by writing a detailed description<\/b> of your reasoning in a short paragraph.  <b>Your justification will be reviewed by several members of the research team.\n<\/b><p><br><\/p><p>After every problem, we will also ask you about how sure you are that the answer you provided is correct.<\/p><p><strong><br><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Please click 'next' to continue.<\/strong><\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataExportTag":"Instructions_IJR","QuestionID":"QID1019"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1071","SecondaryAttribute":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many co...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible.&nbsp;<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div>Please note that we will ask you to<strong> justify your answer<\/strong> to each question <strong>by writing an explanation of your reasoning in a few sentences.<\/strong><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><b>Your justification will be reviewed by several members of the research team. <\/b><\/div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Please click &#39;next&#39; to continue.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Instructions_IJ","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. Your goal is to give as many co...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1071"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1072","SecondaryAttribute":"On the next page