) {\n   \t\te.preventDefault();\n\t\talert(\"This survey does not allow pasting of text!\");\n  \t});\n\t\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID445","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read again carefully: \u00a0 In the next section, we will ask you to solve the same eight word...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"ECB_phase2R","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID465\/SelectableChoice\/5","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">To proceed, please confirm that you read the instructions described above carefully.<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">No, I didn't really<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID465\/SelectableChoice\/5","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID465","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID465","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Please read again carefully: \u00a0 In the next section, we will ask you to solve the same eight word...","QuestionID":"QID445","QuestionText":"<p>Please read again carefully:<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>In the next section, we will ask you<strong> to solve the same eight word problems again<\/strong>.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>This time,&nbsp;<strong>we will give you feedback on your previous answer<\/strong>: we will tell you whether your answer was correct or not and&nbsp;<em>explain<\/em>&nbsp;why this is the case. You will have the opportunity to provide a new answer to the same problem, so if you initially made an incorrect answer then you can change your initial answer.<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>However, if you decide to change your original answer you will then&nbsp;<u>have&nbsp;to complete a word categorisation task<\/u>&nbsp;each time you decide to change your original answer. This will cost you extra time and effort.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><u><strong>You will get extra \u00a30.20 for correcting your originally incorrect response (i.e., as a bonus payment).<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Before we start, we are going to ask you to complete an example of the word categorisation task on the next page.<\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Please read again carefully:<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>In the next section, we will ask you<strong> to solve the same eight word problems again<\/strong>.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>This time,&nbsp;<strong>we will give you feedback on your previous answer<\/strong>: we will tell you whether your answer was correct or not and&nbsp;<em>explain<\/em>&nbsp;why this is the case. You will have the opportunity to provide a new answer to the same problem, so if you initially made an incorrect answer then you can change your initial answer.<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>However, if you decide to change your original answer you will then&nbsp;<u>have&nbsp;to complete a word categorisation task<\/u>&nbsp;each time you decide to change your original answer. This will cost you extra time and effort.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><u><strong>You will get extra \u00a30.20 for correcting your originally incorrect response (i.e., as a bonus payment).<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Before we start, we are going to ask you to complete an example of the word categorisation task on the next page.<\/p>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID448","SecondaryAttribute":"Please read again carefully: In the next section, we will ask you to solve the same eight word pr...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"ENC_phase2R","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID626\/SelectableChoice\/5","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">To proceed, please confirm that you read the instructions described above carefully.<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">No, I didn't really<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID626\/SelectableChoice\/5","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID626","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID626","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Please read again carefully: In the next section, we will ask you to solve the same eight word pr...","QuestionID":"QID448","QuestionText":"<p>Please read again carefully:<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>In the next section, we will ask you <strong>to solve the same eight word problems again<\/strong>.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>This time, <strong>we will give you feedback on your previous answer<\/strong>: we will tell you whether your answer was correct or not and <em>explain<\/em>\n why this is the case. You will have the opportunity to provide a new \nanswer to the same problem, so if you initially made an incorrect answer\n then you can change your initial answer.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Before we start, we are going to ask you to complete a word categorisation task on the next page.<\/p>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Please read again carefully:<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>In the next section, we will ask you <strong>to solve the same eight word problems again<\/strong>.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>This time, <strong>we will give you feedback on your previous answer<\/strong>: we will tell you whether your answer was correct or not and <em>explain<\/em>\n why this is the case. You will