ttribute":"QID573","SecondaryAttribute":"Remember \u00a0 Try your best to answer the word problem and the counting task correctly. \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Remember \u00a0 Try your best to answer the word problem and the counting task correctly. \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0","QuestionText":"<div><u><strong>Remember<\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div><u><strong>Try your best to answer the word problem and the counting task correctly.<\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><u><strong>Remember<\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div><u><strong>Try your best to complete the word problem. <\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><u><strong>You will get extra &pound;0.25 for answering it correctly (i.e., as a bonus payment).<\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataExportTag":"CB_Rem","QuestionID":"QID573"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID568","SecondaryAttribute":"Remember \u00a0 You will get an extra \u00a30.40 for answering the counting task correctly (i.e., as a bonu.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Remember \u00a0 You will get an extra \u00a30.40 for answering the counting task correctly (i.e., as a bonu...","QuestionText":"<div><u><strong>Remember<\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><u><strong>You will get an <span style=\"background-color:#f1c40f;\">extra \u00a30.40<\/span> for answering <span style=\"background-color:#f1c40f;\">the counting task<\/span> correctly (i.e., as a bonus payment).<\/strong><\/u><\/div>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><u><strong>Try your best to complete the counting task. <\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><u><strong>You will get extra &pound;0.25 for answering it correctly (i.e., as a bonus payment).<\/strong><\/u><\/div>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataExportTag":"CC_Rem","QuestionID":"QID568"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID572","SecondaryAttribute":"Remember \u00a0 You will get an extra \u00a30.40 for answering the word problem correctly (i.e., as a bonus.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":1,"QuestionDescription":"Remember \u00a0 You will get an extra \u00a30.40 for answering the word problem correctly (i.e., as a bonus...","QuestionText":"<div><u><strong>Remember<\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div><u><strong>You will get an <span style=\"background-color:#f1c40f;\">extra \u00a30.40<\/span> for answering <span style=\"background-color:#f1c40f;\">the word problem<\/span> correctly (i.e., as a bonus payment).<\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div><u><strong>Remember<\/strong><\/u><\/div><div><u><strong><br><\/strong><\/u><\/div><div><u><strong>Try your best to complete the counting task. <\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><u><strong>You will get extra \u00a30.25 for answering it correctly (i.e., as a bonus payment).<\/strong><\/u><\/div>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type"