y and whether imposing an additional cost discourages them from correcting their mistakes. <br><\/p>\n\n<p><br><\/p><p>If you have any questions regarding the study, please contact: msirota@essex.ac.uk<\/p><p><br><\/p>Dr Miroslav Sirota<br><p>\nDepartment of Psychology<\/p>\n\n<p>University of Essex<\/p>\n\n<p>Wivenhoe Park<\/p>\n\n<p>Colchester<\/p>\n\n<p>United Kingdom<\/p>\n\n<p>CO4 3SQ<\/p><p><br><\/p>\n<br>\nIf you have any comments:<o:p><\/o:p>","QuestionType":"TE","SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"Selector":"ML","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID854","SecondaryAttribute":"The next one is the second and final practice problem! Click the \"Next\" button to continue.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"The next one is the second and final practice problem!<br><br>Click the \"Next\" button to continue.<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q854","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"The next one is the second and final practice problem! Click the \"Next\" button to continue.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID854"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID40","SecondaryAttribute":"The pattern was not completely correct. Make sure to focus on recalling the full pattern on the s...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q131","DefaultChoices":false,"DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID123\/SelectableChoice\/3","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">The pattern was not completely correct. Make sure to focus on\nrecalling the 