 is unloaded*\/\n\n});","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Usain ran a 200-metre race in Paris and achieved the tenth quickest and tenth slowest time. How m...","Choices":{"2":{"Display":"19 runners "},"9":{"Display":"20 runners"},"10":{"Display":"21 runners"},"11":{"Display":"10 runners"}},"ChoiceOrder":[2,"9","10","11"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"RecodeValues":{"2":"1","9":"2","10":"3","11":"4"},"GradingData":[{"ChoiceID":"2","Grades":{"SC_4V0CvXGB2FP6LLE":"0"},"index":1}],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":13,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Usain ran a 200-metre race in Paris and achieved the tenth quickest and tenth slowest time.<br><br>How many runners ran in this race?","DataExportTag":"crt3_IJ_task","QuestionID":"QID991"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1044","SecondaryAttribute":"Usain ran a 200-metre race in Paris and achieved the tenth quickest and tenth slowest time. How m...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Usain ran a 200-metre race in Paris and achieved the tenth quickest and tenth slowest time.<br><br>How many runners ran in this race?","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*\/\n    window.addEventListener('beforeunload', function (e) {\n        var confirmationMessage = 'Are you sure you want to leave this survey?';\n        (e || window.event).returnValue = confirmationMessage; \/\/ Standard for most browsers\n        return confirmationMessage; \/\/ For some older browsers\n    });\n\n\/\/ Add an event listener to detect when the user attempts to leave the page\nwindow.addEventListener('beforeunload', function(event) {\n  \/\/ Display a confirmation message\n  event.returnValue = 'Are you sure you want to leave this page?';\n});\n\n\/\/ Add an event listener to detect when text is copied\ndocument.addEventListener('copy', function(event) {\n  \/\/ Prevent the default copy behavior\n  event.preventDefault();\n  \n  \/\/ Display a message in a pop-up alert\n  alert('This survey does not allow copying of text.');\n});\n\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Usain ran a 200-metre race in Paris and achieved the tenth quickest and tenth slowest time. How m...","Choices":{"2":{"Display":"19 runners "},"9":{"Display":"20 runners"},"10":{"Display":"21 runners"},"11":{"Display":"10 runners"}},"ChoiceOrder":[2,"9","10","11"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"RecodeValues":{"2":"1","9":"2","10":"3","11":"4"},"GradingData":[{"ChoiceID":"2","Grades":{"SC_4V0CvXGB2FP6LLE":"0"},"index":1}],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":13,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Usain ran a 200-metre race in Paris and achieved the tenth quickest and tenth slowest time.<br><br>How many runners ran in this race?","DataExportTag":"crt3_IJ_task","QuestionID":"QID1044"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID371","SecondaryAttribute":"We are going to start with a couple of practice problems. First, a fixation cross will appear. Th...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We are going to start with a couple of practice problems. First, a fixation cross will appear. Then, the problem will be presented.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nAs we told you we are interested in your initial, intuitive response. First, we&nbsp;want you to respond with the very first answer that comes to mind. You don't need to think about it. Just give the first answer that intuitively comes to mind as quickly as possible. To assure this, a time limit was set for the first response, which is going to be 4 seconds. When there is 1 second left, the background colour will turn to yellow to let you know that&nbsp;the deadline is approaching. Please make sure to answer before the deadline passes.&nbsp; Next, the problem will be presented again and you can take all the time you want to actively reflect on it. Once you have made up your mind you enter your final response.<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\nAfter you made your choice and clicked on it, you will be automatically taken to the next page.<br>\n<br>\nAfter you have entered your first and final answer we will also ask you to indicate your confidence in the correctness of your response.<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nPress \"Next\" if you are ready to start the practice session!","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q115","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We are going to start with a couple of practice problems. First, a fixation cross will appear. Th...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"We are going to start with a couple of practice problems. First, a fixation cross will appear. Then, the first sentence of the problem is going to be presented for 2 seconds. Next, the rest of the problem will be presented.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nAs we told you we are interested in your initial, intuitive response. First, we&nbsp;want you to respond with the very first answer that comes to mind. You don't need to think about it. Just give the first answer that intuitively comes to mind as quickly as possible. To assure this, a time limit was set for the first response, which is going to be 4 seconds. When there is 1 second left, the background colour will turn to yellow to let you know that&nbsp;the deadline is approaching. Please make sure to answer before the deadline passes.&nbsp; Next, the problem will be presented again and you can take all the time you want to actively reflect on it. Once you have made up your mind you enter your final response.<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\nAfter you made your choice and clicked on it, you will be automatically taken to the next page.<br>\n<br>\nAfter you have entered your first and final answer we will also ask you to indicate your confidence in the correctness of your response.<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nPress \"Next\" if you are ready to start the practice session!","QuestionID":"QID371","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID9","SecondaryAttribute":"We are going to start with a couple of practice problems. First, a short instruction will appear....","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"pracice_instructions","DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionDescription":"We are going to start with a couple of practice problems. First, a short instruction will appear....","QuestionID":"QID9","QuestionText":"We are going to start with a couple of<em> practice problems<\/em>. First, a short instruction will appear. Then, a fixation cross will appear. Next, the first sentence of the problem will be presented. Finally, the rest of the problem will be presented.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nWe are interested in your initial, intuitive response. <strong>To assure this, a time limit has been set for your response, which is going to be a few seconds<\/strong>. When there is 1 second left, the background colour will turn to <span style=\"background-color:#f1c40f;\">yellow<\/span> to let you know that&nbsp;the deadline is approaching. Please make sure to answer before the deadline passes.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\nAfter you make your choice and click on it,<u> you will be automatically taken to the next page<\/u>.<br><br>After you have entered your first answer we will also ask you to indicate your confidence in the correctness of your response.<br>\n<br>\nPress \"Next\" button, if you are ready to start the practice session!","QuestionText_Unsafe":"We are going to start with a couple of practice problems. First, a fixation cross will appear. Then, the first sentence of the problem is going to be presented for 2 seconds. Next, the rest of the problem will be presented.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\nAs we told you we are interested in your initial, intuitive response. First, we&nbsp;want you to respond with the very first answer that comes to mind. You don't need to think about it. Just give the first answer that intuitively comes to mind as quickly as possible. To assure this, a time limit was set for the first response, which is going to be 4 seconds. When there is 1 second left, the background colour will turn to yellow to let you know that&nbsp;the deadline is approaching. Please make sure to answer before the deadline passes.&nbsp; Next, the problem will be presented again and you can take all the time you want to actively reflect on it. Once you have made up your mind you enter your final response.<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\nAfter you made your choice and clicked on it, you will be automatically taken to the next page.<br>\n<br>\nAfter you have entered your first and final answer we will also ask you to indicate your confidence in the correctness of your response.<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nPress \"Next\" if you are ready to start the practice session!","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID363","SecondaryAttribute":"We have one last question for you, have a look at the following problem: A bat and ball cost $1.1...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We have one last question for you, have a look at the following problem:<br \/>\n<br \/>\nA bat and ball cost $1.10.<br \/>\nThe bat costs one dollar more than the ball.<br \/>\nHow much does the ball cost?<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px;\">Have you seen\/solved this specific problem before, or have you read about it?<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Q382","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We have one last question for you, have a look at the following problem: A bat and ball cost $1.1...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"We have one last question for you, have a look at the following problem:<br \/>\n<br \/>\nA bat and ball cost $1.10.<br \/>\nThe bat costs one dollar more than the ball.<br \/>\nHow much does the ball cost?<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8000001907349px;\">Have you seen\/solved this specific problem before, or have you read about it?<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n&nbsp;","QuestionID":"QID363"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID8","SecondaryAttribute":"Welcome to the experiment! Please read these instructions carefully! This experiment is composed...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I confirm that I read the instructions carefully"}},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q1","DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionDescription":"Welcome to the experiment! Please read these instructions carefully! This experiment is composed...","QuestionID":"QID8","QuestionText":"<strong>Welcome to the experiment!<br>\n<br>\nPlease read these instructions carefully!<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nThis experiment is composed of 8 questions and a couple of practice questions. It will take about 10 minutes to complete and it demands your full attention. You can only do this experiment once.\n<div><br>\nIn this task we'll present you with a set of reasoning problems. We want to know what your initial, intuitive response to these problems is and how you respond after you have thought about the problem for some more time. Hence, as soon as the problem is presented, we will ask you to enter your initial response. We want you to respond with the very first answer that comes to mind. You don't need to think about it. Just give the first answer that intuitively comes to mind as quickly as possible.&nbsp;Next, the problem will be presented again and you can take all the time you want to actively reflect on it. Once you have made up your mind you enter your final response. You will have as much time as you need to indicate your second response.<\/div>\n\n<div><br>\nAfter you have entered your first and final answer we will also ask you to indicate your confidence in the correctness of your response.<br>\n<br>\nIn sum, keep in mind that it is really crucial that you give your first, initial response as fast as possible.<br>\nAfterwards, you can take as much time as you want to reflect on the problem and select your final response.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>You will receive $0.20&nbsp;for completing this experiment.<br>\n<br>\nPlease confirm below that you read these instructions carefully and then press the \"Next\" button. .<\/div>","QuestionText_