ionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Welcome to the experiment! Please read these instructions carefully! This experiment is composed...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I confirm that I read the instructions carefully"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<strong>Welcome to the experiment!<br \/>\n<br \/>\nPlease read these instructions carefully!<\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis experiment is composed of 8 questions and a couple of practice questions. It will take about 10 minutes to complete and it demands your full attention. You can only do this experiment once.\n<div><br \/>\nIn this task we&#39;ll present you with a set of reasoning problems. We want to know what your initial, intuitive response to these problems is and how you respond after you have thought about the problem for some more time. Hence, as soon as the problem is presented, we will ask you to enter your initial response. We want you to respond with the very first answer that comes to mind. You don&#39;t need to think about it. Just give the first answer that intuitively comes to mind as quickly as possible.&nbsp;Next, the problem will be presented again and you can take all the time you want to actively reflect on it. Once you have made up your mind you enter your final response. You will have as much time as you need to indicate your second response.<\/div>\n\n<div><br \/>\nAfter you have entered your first and final answer we will also ask you to indicate your confidence in the correctness of your response.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIn sum, keep in mind that it is really crucial that you give your first, initial response as fast as possible.<br \/>\nAfterwards, you can take as much time as you want to reflect on the problem and select your final response.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>You will receive $0.20&nbsp;for completing this experiment.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nPlease confirm below that you read these instructions carefully and then press the &quot;Next&quot; button.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q43","QuestionID":"QID370"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID836","SecondaryAttribute":"Well done for completing the practice example!\u00a0 On the next pages, we are going to ask you to sol..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"practice_CG_feedback","DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Well done for completing the practice example!\u00a0 On the next pages, we are going to ask you to sol...","QuestionText":"Well done for completing the practice example!&nbsp;<br><br>On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible<\/b>.\n\n<br><br>Click the \"Next\" button if you are ready to begin.<br>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Well done! Click \"Next\" to continue<br>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"QuestionID":"QID836","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID908","SecondaryAttribute":"Well done for completing the practice example!\u00a0On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solv..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Well done for completing the practice example!\u00a0On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solv...","QuestionText":"Well done for completing the practice example!&nbsp;On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible<\/b>.<br><b><br><\/b>Please remember that we will ask you to justify your answer to each question by <b>writing an explanation of your reasoning in a few sentences.<\/b><br>\n<br>\nClick the \"Next\" button if you are ready to begin.","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Well done for completing the practice example!&nbsp;On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible<\/b>.\r\n\r\n<br><br>Click the \"Next\" button if you are ready to begin.<br>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"DataExportTag":"practice_BJ_feedback","QuestionID":"QID908"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID972","SecondaryAttribute":"Well done for completing the practice example!\u00a0On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solv..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Well done for completing the practice example!\u00a0On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solv...","QuestionText":"Well done for completing the practice example!&nbsp;On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible<\/b>.\n\n<br><br>Remember that in this study, <b>we are interested in the process that you used to get to your answer.<\/b> Therefore, please note that you will have to <b>explain your answer to the problem by writing a detailed description<\/b> of your reasoning in a brief paragraph. <b>Your justification will be reviewed by several members of the research team.\n<\/b><br><br>Click the \"Next\" button if you are ready to begin.<br>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Well done for completing the practice example!&nbsp;On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible<\/b>.\n\n<br><br>Please remember that we will ask you to justify your answer to each question by <b>writing an explanation of your reasoning in one sentence or more.<\/b><br><br>After every problem, we will also ask you about how sure you are that the answer you provided is correct.<br><br>Click the \"Next\" button if you are ready to begin.<br>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"DataExportTag":"practice_IJ_feedback","QuestionID":"QID972"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1025","SecondaryAttribute":"Well done for completing the practice example!\u00a0On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solv..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"Well done for completing the practice example!\u00a0On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solv...","QuestionText":"Well done for completing the practice example!&nbsp;On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible<\/b>.<br><br><p>Please note that we will ask you to <strong>justify your answer<\/strong> to each question by <b>writing an explanation of your reasoning in a few sentences.<\/b><br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<div><\/div><b>Our research team is interested in understanding the reasoning process behind your answer.<br><\/b><br>\nClick the \"Next\" button if you are ready to begin.<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Well done for completing the practice example!&nbsp;On the next pages, we are going to ask you to solve six problems. <b>Your goal is to give as many correct answers as possible<\/b>.\n\n<br><br>Remember that in this study, <b>we are interested in the process that you used to get to your answer.<\/b> Therefore, please note that you will have to <b>explain your answer to the problem by writing a detailed description<\/b> of your reasoning in a short paragraph. <b>Your justification will be reviewed by several members of the research team.\n<\/b><br><br>After every problem, we will also ask you about how sure you are that the answer you provided is correct.<br><br>Click the \"Next\" button if you are ready to begin.<br>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"DataExportTag":"practice_IJ_feedback","QuestionID":"QID1025"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID612","SecondaryAttribute":"Well done! Click \"Next\" to continue","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Well done! Click \"Next\" to continue<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q612","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Well done! Click \"Next\" to continue","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID612"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID604","SecondaryAttribute":"Well done! Click \"Next\" when you are ready to start.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>Well done! <br><\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Click \"Next\" when you are ready to start.<br><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q604","QuestionID":"QID604","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Well done! Click \"Next\" when you are ready to start.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_8iFeD0xUZQZDDCK","Elemen